---
source: crates/mori-checker/src/tests.rs
description: "Code:\n\nprofile \"moriarty-beta/1\";\nagreement Transfer {\n  domain Preview = { id: \"preview\", chain: \"midnight\", network: \"preview\" };\n  asset USD = { domain: Preview, id: \"usd\", scale: 0, representation: \"native\" };\n  asset GOLD = { domain: Preview, id: \"gold\", scale: 0, representation: \"native\" };\n  account alice = { domain: Preview, id: \"alice\" };\n  account bob = { domain: Preview, id: \"bob\" };\n  account carol = { domain: Preview, id: \"carol\" };\n  intent pay = {\n    domain: Preview, asset: USD, signer: bob, key: \"k\", nonce: \"n\", pre_head: \"h\",\n    valid: rounds(domain: Preview, from: 0, to: 10),\n    gross_cap: 170141183460469231731687303715884105728 USD, fee_cap: 0 USD, net_floor: 1 USD,\n    operation: transfer(from: alice, to: bob, fee_to: carol, value: 1 GOLD, fee: 0 GOLD),\n    source_hash: \"s\", policy_digest: \"p\", failure: SuccessOnly,\n    observations: [], disclosures: [], retained_effects: [], retained_duties: [],\n    delegation: None, recovery: None,\n  };\n}\n"
---
mori::check::wrong_signer

  × The signer must be the `from` account, `alice`, but it is `bob`.
    ╭─[test.mori:10:42]
  9 │   intent pay = {
 10 │     domain: Preview, asset: USD, signer: bob, key: "k", nonce: "n", pre_head: "h",
    ·                                          ─┬─
    ·                                           ╰── the signer
 11 │     valid: rounds(domain: Preview, from: 0, to: 10),
 12 │     gross_cap: 170141183460469231731687303715884105728 USD, fee_cap: 0 USD, net_floor: 1 USD,
 13 │     operation: transfer(from: alice, to: bob, fee_to: carol, value: 1 GOLD, fee: 0 GOLD),
    ·                               ──┬──
    ·                                 ╰── the `from` account
 14 │     source_hash: "s", policy_digest: "p", failure: SuccessOnly,
    ╰────
  help: Only the owner of the funds can sign for them.

mori::check::too_large_for_s0

  × `gross_cap` is too large for an operation that runs locally.
    ╭─[test.mori:12:16]
 11 │     valid: rounds(domain: Preview, from: 0, to: 10),
 12 │     gross_cap: 170141183460469231731687303715884105728 USD, fee_cap: 0 USD, net_floor: 1 USD,
    ·                ─────────────────────┬─────────────────────
    ·                                     ╰── more than 2^127-1
 13 │     operation: transfer(from: alice, to: bob, fee_to: carol, value: 1 GOLD, fee: 0 GOLD),
    ╰────

mori::check::wrong_asset

  × `value` must be a `USD` amount because it must be in the intent's `asset`,
  │ but it is a `GOLD` amount.
    ╭─[test.mori:13:69]
 12 │     gross_cap: 170141183460469231731687303715884105728 USD, fee_cap: 0 USD, net_floor: 1 USD,
 13 │     operation: transfer(from: alice, to: bob, fee_to: carol, value: 1 GOLD, fee: 0 GOLD),
    ·                                                                     ───┬──
    ·                                                                        ╰── a `GOLD` amount
 14 │     source_hash: "s", policy_digest: "p", failure: SuccessOnly,
    ╰────

mori::check::wrong_asset

  × `fee` must be a `USD` amount because it must be in the intent's `asset`,
  │ but it is a `GOLD` amount.
    ╭─[test.mori:13:82]
 12 │     gross_cap: 170141183460469231731687303715884105728 USD, fee_cap: 0 USD, net_floor: 1 USD,
 13 │     operation: transfer(from: alice, to: bob, fee_to: carol, value: 1 GOLD, fee: 0 GOLD),
    ·                                                                                  ───┬──
    ·                                                                                     ╰── a `GOLD` amount
 14 │     source_hash: "s", policy_digest: "p", failure: SuccessOnly,
    ╰────
